<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <title>In The Beginning</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <div class="window">
        <div class="title-bar">
            <span>Decisons</span>
            <div class="buttons">
                <span>X</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="window-content">
            Forget your childhood. It's not important <span class="rotated">(right?)</span>. You're an adult now, and adults must make adult choices. 
            Make a decision about the rest of your future. <b> Don't look back. </b>
            <a href="Decisions" class="btn">Go To College</a>
            <a href="Decisions" class="btn">Dont Go To College</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
<style>
    body {
        background-color: black;
        height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .window {
        width: 500px;
        background-color: #c0c0c0;
        border: 2px solid;
        border-color: white #404040 #404040 white;
        /* 3D effect */
        box-shadow: inset -1px -1px 0 #000, inset 1px 1px 0 #fff;
        font-family: "MS Sans Serif", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .title-bar {
        background: linear-gradient(to right, navy, blue);
        color: white;
        padding: 5px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .buttons span {
        background: #c0c0c0;
        border: 1px solid #000;
        padding: 0 5px;
        margin-left: 3px;
        font-size: 12px;
    }

    .rotated {
  display: inline-block;
  rotate: 15deg;
    }

    .window-content {
        padding: 20px;
        color: black;
        text-align: center;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
    }

    .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-right: 10px;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: black;
        background-color: #c0c0c0;
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 2px solid;
        border-color: white #404040 #404040 white;
        box-shadow: inset -1px -1px 0 #000, inset 1px 1px 0 #fff;
    }
</style>

</html>